  "description": "Codex: Orks (11e) READIED BRAWLERS (Blitz Brigade, 1 CP) through the real unit_ended_normal_move window and its assault-disembark follow-up. Setup embarks the Flash Gitz and the Tankbustas in the Battlewagon (a WAGON). The player clicks the Battlewagon, drags it 2\" east and locks the move in: the window opens for the Ork player before any opponent reaction (01.03.02), with an enabled 'Use on Battlewagon' button. A real click on Use spends 1 CP and starts the follow-up: the Disembark dialog opens for the Flash Gitz (18.06 assault disembark: set-up within 3\", and the unit can still charge). The player confirms and clicks five spots beside the hull; the Flash Gitz are on the board and NOT barred from charging. The follow-up then offers the Tankbustas; 'Stay Embarked' keeps them aboard, the follow-up ends, and the WAGON loses the READIED BRAWLERS flag. Setup-only privileges: Blitz Brigade detachment (stratagems reloaded); the two units embarked; Skip Overwatch toggled on (Fire Overwatch is not under test).",
